"Probabilitas bahwa hasil Alice dan Bob sesuai adalah kosinus-kuadrat dari sudut ini,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\cos^2\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\Bigr) = \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{4},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\cos^2\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\Bigr) = \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{4},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "while the probability they disagree is the sine-squared of this angle,\n"
msgstr "sedangkan probabilitas mereka tidak sesuai adalah sinus-kuadrat dari sudut ini,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sin^2\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\Bigr) = \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sin^2\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\Bigr) = \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
