"Probabilitas bahwa hasil Alice dan Bob sesuai lagi-lagi adalah kosinus-kuadrat dari sudut ini,\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When $(x,y) = (1,0)$, Alice and Bob choose $\\alpha = \\pi/4$ and $\\beta = \\pi/8$, and by superimposing their bases we obtain this figure:\n"
msgstr "Ketika $(x,y) = (1,0)$, Alice dan Bob memilih $\\alpha = \\pi/4$ dan $\\beta = \\pi/8$, dan dengan menumpangkan basis mereka kita mendapatkan gambar ini:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Alice and Bob bases case 1](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/entanglement-in-action/strategy10.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Alice and Bob bases case 1](/learning/images/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/entanglement-in-action/strategy10.avif)\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The bases have changed but the angles haven't — once again the angle between vectors of the same color is $\\pi/8$.\n"
